@startuml b-seq-main
title Вариант B. Основной сценарий: транзакционное уведомление доставлено через push
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Платёжный\nсервис" as P
participant "Notification\nAPI" as API
participant "Temporal\nServer" as T
database "Cassandra\n(история)" as C
participant "Delivery Worker\n(workflow + activities)" as W
database "Redis\n(кеш)" as R
participant "FCM /\nAPNs" as FCM
actor "Мобильное\nприложение" as APP
participant "Receipt\nGateway" as RG
queue "Kafka" as K

P -> API: SendNotification(idempotency_key = "pay-123:debited",\ntype = TRANSACTIONAL, user_id, template, params)
API -> T: StartWorkflow(CriticalDelivery,\nworkflow_id = UUIDv5(producer, idempotency_key),\nreuse_policy = RejectDuplicate)
T -> C: WorkflowExecutionStarted
T --> API: run_id (повторный старт с тем же id →\nWorkflowAlreadyStarted, дубль не создаётся)
API --> P: 202 Accepted {notification_id = workflow_id}

T -> W: workflow task (task queue critical-delivery)
W -> W: activity BuildRoutingPlan
W -> R: настройки + активные push-токены
R --> W: план [push, sms, email]
W -> T: ScheduleActivity SendPush
T -> C: ActivityTaskScheduled
T -> W: activity task SendPush
W -> FCM: send(token, collapse_id = notification_id,\ndata = {notification_id, attempt_id})
FCM --> W: 200 OK
W -> T: ActivityTaskCompleted
W -> T: workflow: await Signal("receipt") ИЛИ Timer(10 с)
T -> C: TimerStarted

FCM -> APP: push-уведомление
APP -> RG: POST /receipts {notification_id, attempt_id}
RG -> T: SignalWorkflow(workflow_id, receipt{push, attempt_id})
T -> C: WorkflowExecutionSignaled; таймер отменён
T -> W: workflow task
W -> T: ScheduleActivity PublishStatus
T -> W: activity task
W -> K: notif.status: DELIVERED {channel = push}
W -> T: CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED)
T -> C: WorkflowExecutionCompleted
note over P, K: ≈ 25 событий истории на уведомление (на схеме показаны ключевые; каждое — запись в Cassandra).\nПлюс ~10–30 мс задержки на каждый оборот workflow ↔ Temporal (расчёт в RFC, раздел 6.4)
@enduml
